---
// Mini Preview: tooltip（气泡提示）-- 纯静态，零 JS，Gallery/Stream 用
---
<div class="w-full aspect-[16/9] bg-canvas border border-line rounded-card overflow-hidden p-4 relative">
  <div class="absolute inset-4 card-surface rounded-control p-4 flex items-center justify-center gap-3">
    <span class="text-[11px] text-muted">将鼠标悬停在此按钮…</span>
    <span class="btn btn--ghost rounded-control px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] relative">保存</span>
    <!-- 气泡 -->
    <div class="absolute top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 mt-7 bg-dark-bg text-white text-[9px] px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-control shadow-card">
      保存到收藏夹（Ctrl+S）
      <span class="absolute left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -top-1 w-0 h-0 border-x-4 border-x-transparent border-b-4 border-b-dark-bg"></span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>